{"id":"domenica","lemma":"domenica","pos":"noun","rank":1289,"glosses":["Sunday"],"ipa":"/doˈme.ni.ka/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"domeniche"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/df/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-domenica.wav","examples":[{"text":"Domani è domenica.","en":"Tomorrow is Sunday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1004693","words":[{"g":"tomorrow"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},null]},{"text":"Che fai domenica?","en":"What do you do on Sunday?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to do","l":"fare"},null]},{"text":"Puoi venire domenica sera?","en":"Can you come on Sunday evening?","words":[{"g":"can, could","l":"potere"},{"g":"to come"},null,{"g":"evening"}]},{"text":"È aperto di domenica?","en":"Is it open on Sunday?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1006382","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"open"},{"g":"of"},null]},{"text":"Gioca a golf tutte le domeniche.","en":"He plays golf every Sunday.","words":[{"g":"to play a game","l":"giocare"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"golf"},{"g":"everything, all","l":"tutto"},{"g":"the / to her"},null]}]}